Ontology-RGAT UAV landing: Isaac Sim + PX4
==========================================

Third-party work this repository derives from
---------------------------------------------

python/ontology_rgat/rgat/layers.py is a PyTorch reimplementation of the
relational graph attention layer described in

    D. Busbridge, D. Sherburn, P. Cavallo and N. Y. Hammerla,
    "Relational Graph Attention Networks", 2019.
    https://openreview.net/forum?id=Bklzkh0qFm

and released by the authors as

    https://github.com/babylonhealth/rgat
    Copyright 2019 Babylon Partners
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

No source from that repository is vendored here: it targets TensorFlow 1.x,
which does not run on this workspace's Python 3.10 / ROS 2 Humble / Isaac Sim
5.1 baseline. What is carried over is the model -- the ARGAT and WIRGAT
attention normalisations, the additive and multiplicative attention styles,
multi-head aggregation, and the basis decomposition of the relational kernels.
The batched dense formulation, the learned per-relation embedding in the
attention logits, and everything else in this repository are our own.

